# ============================================
# NOTES
# ============================================
# 
# Keep in repo:
# ✓ pyproject.toml (source of truth for dependencies)
# ✓ requirements.txt (optional: generated lock file)
# ✓ README.md
# ✓ SKILL.md
# ✓ All .py source files
# ✓ Shell scripts (.sh)
# ✓ Tests
# ✓ Documentation
# 
# Never commit:
# ✗ .venv/ (virtual environment)
# ✗ __pycache__/ (compiled bytecode)
# ✗ *.log (logs may contain sensitive data)
# ✗ .env (secrets/credentials)
# ✗ backups/ (generated automatically)
# ✗ leo_conversation_url_*.txt (per-process temp files)
topdy.py
*.bak

